        "original_id": "8ce41adb-80a4-5229-bab5-6b37f5246bd4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Big Data\n- Songs: \"Dangerous\"\n- Releases: \"1.0\", \"2.0\"\n- Collaborators: Joywave\n- Charts and Certifications: Billboard Alternative Songs chart, RIAA\n\nFacts:\n- Big Data released its debut EP \"1.0\" in 2013, and the song \"Dangerous\" appeared on that EP.\n- In August 2014, Big Data's single \"Dangerous\", featuring Joywave, reached number one on the Billboard Alternative Songs chart.\n- In May 2015, the RIAA certified Big Data's single \"Dangerous\" gold.\n- Big Data released its debut studio album \"2.0\" in 2015, and the song \"Dangerous\" appeared on that album.\n- Big Data is an American electronic music project best known for the single \"Dangerous\".",
